cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the thesis below."
title: "When Confidence Lies: Deep Feature Modeling versus Post-hoc Softmax Scores for Out-of-Distribution Detection in Streaming Time Series"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Giannoulis
    given-names: Stylianos
    affiliation: "Aristotle University of Thessaloniki (AUTH), MSc in Data and Web Science"
year: 2026
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible study of out-of-distribution (OOD) detection for streaming time
  series. It audits OOD detectors for faithfulness to their source papers, evaluates
  the faithful set on the TSB-StreamingAD benchmark, and shows that distance- and
  density-based detectors dominate post-hoc softmax detectors.
